    "answer": "A",
    "acceptedAnswers": null,
    "answerUnit": null,
    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Isosceles triangle $ABH$",
        "body": "Each interior angle of a regular octagon is $\\frac{(8-2)\\cdot180^\\circ}8=135^\\circ$. Triangle $ABH$ is isosceles with $AB=AH$ and apex angle $135^\\circ$, so $\\angle ABH=\\frac{180^\\circ-135^\\circ}2=22\\frac12^\\circ$. Then $\\angle HBC=\\angle ABC-\\angle ABH=135^\\circ-22\\frac12^\\circ=112\\frac12^\\circ$.\n\n**Answer: (A) $112\\frac12^\\circ$**"
      }
    ],
