      {
        "title": "Divisibility",
        "body": "The left side $6x+15y=3(2x+5y)$ is a multiple of 3 for all integers $x,y$, but $85$ is not a multiple of 3. So there are no solutions.\n\n**Answer: (A) 0**"
      }
